<%- include('partials/head',{title}) %><%- include('partials/nav') %><main class="wrap page-main narrow-main"><div class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</div><h1 class="display-title">Technology that makes care feel more human.</h1><p class="large-copy">CareNest is a college project exploring how an accessible hospital appointment experience can be combined with self-healing software principles.</p><div class="panel"><h2>What CareNest demonstrates</h2><ul class="recovery-list"><li><span>✓</span>Accessible navigation and readable interface for older adults.</li><li><span>✓</span>Patient account creation, sign-in and temporary lockout after repeated failed attempts.</li><li><span>✓</span>Appointment booking, history, cancellation and family-member booking fields.</li><li><span>✓</span>Waiting list and a basic slot-offer workflow with staff confirmation.</li><li><span>✓</span>Health checks, incident logs and safe fallback behaviour for selected failures.</li></ul></div><p class="form-note">This is an educational demonstration, not a certified clinical system. Do not use it for real medical records or emergencies.</p></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
